# Line-ending policy for the Claude OS tree.
#
# The Workflow permission dialog rejects CR (0x0d) as a hidden control character,
# so workflow/skill files must never carry CRLF on checkout. core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise convert them to CRLF on Windows and break `Workflow` launches.
# Force LF for the whole .claude tree (and JS sources) regardless of platform.

.claude/**      text eol=lf
*.js            text eol=lf
*.mjs           text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf

# Generated report/design assets: keep LF too for consistency.
*.css           text eol=lf
